### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Fernanda Souza",
  "email": "fernanda.souza@outlook.com",
  "senha": "pixel2026",
  "cpf": "98765432100",
  "telefone": "48988776655"
}

###

### Fazer Login com Fernanda (Armazena o token automaticamente)

# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "fernanda.souza@outlook.com",
    "senha": "pixel2026"
}

###

### 2. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Consultar Cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Apagar Cliente
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json



###

### 5. Cadastrar Console
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Nintendo Switch OLED",
  "marca": "Nintendo",
  "numeroSerie": "XKW50012345678",
  "tipo": "Mídia Física",
  "idCliente": 1
}

### 6. Listar Consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Cadastrar Agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-18",
  "hora": "09:00:00",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 1
}

### 8. Listar Agendamentos
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 9. Atualizar Agendamento
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-11-25",
    "hora": "10:45:00"
}
